{"parse": {"title": "归位的承诺", "pageid": 139415, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"归位的承诺\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d4/CurrencyItem-3702.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"归位的承诺\" width=\"262\" height=\"241\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"262\" data-file-height=\"241\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>归位的承诺</b><img alt=\"CurrencyIcon-3702 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/CurrencyIcon-3702_1.png/24px-CurrencyIcon-3702_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/CurrencyIcon-3702_1.png/36px-CurrencyIcon-3702_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/CurrencyIcon-3702_1.png/48px-CurrencyIcon-3702_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"54\" data-file-height=\"54\" /><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>2#3702</div></div><hr /><div>管理室临时启用的“外借券”，曾是管理员空脑袋为清点仓库用的备忘便签，如今用于登记藏品借用者的承诺。可用于神秘学藏品管理室兑换。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">旧便签上的折痕与略显模糊的字迹，都无损于其上承诺的重量，也不曾折减每一句感谢的真挚。请物尽其用吧，在雨落下前。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "归位的承诺"}}